# Copy to terraform.tfvars only if you want a local var file.
# Do not put secrets in it. terraform.tfvars is gitignored.
#
# The bot header comes from TF_VAR_bot_api_key, or from API_KEY in .env.
# cron-job.org uses CRON_JOB_API_KEY.
# R2 uses AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID and AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
# (R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID and R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY are accepted too).
